WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.400
[Cinematic orchestra and pulsing synths: “Legacy” by Scott Buckley] Tesla studio imagery: the Roadster viewed from behind in a pool of light.

00:06.400 --> 00:11.800
The Roadster’s side profile. A slow editorial pan across Tesla’s studio image, with a soft transition sweep.

00:11.800 --> 00:18.200
Inside the cockpit: a yoke, a centre touchscreen and two forward displays.

00:18.200 --> 00:23.600
A published mechanical close-up showing suspension and the vehicle’s internal structure.

00:23.600 --> 00:31.000
[Music swells; editorial low impact] Tesla reveal footage: the Roadster in a programmed ramp demonstration. This is an edited sequence, not a test measurement.

00:31.000 --> 00:42.400
[Orchestra and synths rise] The Roadster flies above a line-up of Tesla vehicles during the controlled reveal demonstration.

00:42.400 --> 00:50.400
Front three-quarter studio view. Images and reveal footage: Tesla. Music: “Legacy” by Scott Buckley, CC BY 4.0. Edit and additional sound design: Supercharged Daily.
